Montage isolated craft renderer third-party binaries

The renderer distributes the following upstream command-line binaries under
Apache-2.0. Each binary download is pinned by SHA-256 in its Dockerfile.
The Apache license was verified at each exact release tag on 2026-10-24.

PDFCraft v0.5.0: https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/tree/v0.5.0
PhotoCraft v0.6.0: https://github.com/storytold/photocraft/tree/v0.6.0
LightCraft v0.5.0: https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/tree/v0.5.0
VectorCraft v0.8.0: https://github.com/storytold/vectorcraft/tree/v0.8.0

Upstream copyright and additional license/notice files are preserved from
the release archives. Montage does not modify these binaries. Its Python
validation, transport, job and review wrappers are separate repository code.
